== Effect ==
* Causes Isaac's [[familiar]]s to stay closer to Isaac.
* {{dlc|r+}} Increases damage and size of all [[familiar]]s by 25%.
** Size increase doesn't stack with such from {{I|BFFS!}}, but damage multiplier does, resulting in 2.25x damage.

== Notes ==
* {{dlc+|a+}} This trinket affects the same familiars {{I|King Baby}} effects. For a list of the familiars unaffected by this trinket, visit King Baby's page.{{dlc-}}

== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: Having either now increases the damage of all familiars by 50%. Having both by 75%.

== Interactions ==
* {{T|Friendship Necklace}}: Familiars orbit much closer to Isaac.
* {{I|King Baby}}: Familiars stay closer to King Baby while Isaac is firing.

